Place completed rewrite batches per locale:

- `tr/batch-01.json` — Turkish prose patches → `data/cards.tr.json`
- `en/batch-01.json` — English prose patches → `data/cards.en.json`

Each file: `{ "cards": [ { "id", "whatWeSee", "realHistory", … } ] }`

Apply: `npm run content:voice:apply -- --write`
